      "role": "user",
      "content": "interesting. so u think the main issue is that the rules basically just exist to help the big banks stay on top? i mean, if we just cut back the oversight to help startups, wouldn't that just increase the risk of fraud or people losing their money? like, is there a way to be 'smart' without just leaving consumers unprotected?",
